  "verses": [
    {
      "v": 1,
      "zh": "「我今日所吩咐的一切诫命，你们要谨守遵行，好叫你们存活，人数增多，且进去得耶和华向你们列祖起誓应许的那地。",
      "en": "You must keep carefully all these commandments[NOTE:1] I am giving[NOTE:2] you today so that you may live, increase in number,[NOTE:3] and go in and occupy the land that the Lord promised to your ancestors.[NOTE:4]",
      "notes": [
        "The singular term (מִצְוָה, mitsvah) includes the whole corpus of covenant stipulations, certainly the book of Deuteronomy at least (cf. Deut 5:28; 6:1, 25; 7:11; 11:8, 22; 15:5; 17:20; 19:9; 27:1; 30:11; 31:5). The plural (מִצְוֹת, mitsvot) refers to individual stipulations (as in vv. 2, 6).",
        "Heb “commanding” (so NASB). For stylistic reasons, to avoid redundancy, “giving” has been used in the translation (likewise in v. 11).",
        "Heb “multiply” (so KJV, NASB, NLT); NIV, NRSV “increase.”",
        "Heb “fathers” (also in vv. 16, 18)."
      ],
